      <guid isPermaLink="false">222b19d</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 01:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>gh-commits-plugins-official</category>
      <description>Instrument-first for the macOS Python-3.9 cohort.  v2.0.6 telemetry: ~13.6% of macOS sessions (~6,337 users) run on Apple&apos;s Python 3.9 → HOOK_PY_INCOMPATIBLE → the agentic reviewer can&apos;t load (needs 3.10+ syntax). That&apos;s ~12x macOS&apos;s build-failure rate and the single biggest macOS degradation. sg-py</description>
    </item>
